# Telegram List Authority — 파일락

감사 SSOT: `docs/community-messenger/telegram-list-authority-writer-audit.md`  
검증: `npm run verify:telegram-list-authority`

## 계약

방→리스트 remount (hydrated):

- memory paint only
- **금지:** `refresh(true)` silent · critical_patch→partial_upsert · Gate TTL remount fetch · prefetch always-revalidate · CM dual-write trade/SO paint · full replace

Surface reducer 1개:

- hub GD+group → `applyHomeListPatch` only
- trade / store_order → Domain canary + `domain-list-canary-realtime-patch` only

## DO NOT

- remount 치유용 신규 cold/tip/dwell lock 추가
- dual-write를 trade/SO list truth로 복원
- MARK_READ/PARTICIPANT_UNREAD로 preview/LMA 쓰기
- 서버 PATCH 실패 시 전체 list refetch
